omanWeight}(f) \\ge 4$. If $\\text{radius}(G) \\le 3$, `omega` closes it.\n\n### 4. Active Context\n- Working Directory: `/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9`.\n- Latest verification task `task-1199` ran `check.sh test_clean_unique.lean` containing the corrected `radius_add_one_le_romanWeight_of_unique_two`.\n- Background subagent `f458c9cf-488d-4cd8-8365-7c4e4b16e3f9` is also present.\n\n### 5. Next Steps\n1. Verify `test_clean_unique.lean` passed `check.sh`.\n2. Append the verified lemmas (`ballWithin_one_eq_univ_of_adj_all`, `radius_le_one_of_adj_all`, `radius_le_one_of_romanWeight_le_two`, `radius_add_one_le_romanWeight_of_unique_two`) into `Challenge_e20263a9.lean`.\n3. Fill the proof of `theorem prove_e20263a9 : Candidate := by ...` in `Challenge_e20263a9.lean`, leaving `theorem refute_e20263a9 : ¬ Candidate` untouched with its `sorry`.\n4. Run `/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh Challenge_e20263a9.lean`. Confirm exit code 0, no `sorryAx` on `prove_e20263a9`, and allowed axioms `[propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]`.\n5. Write `REPORT.md` containing: settled direction (Proven), key mathematical idea, and verbatim final `check.sh` output.\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Hard rule: Change nothing above line 15 (imports, options, `Candidate`).\n- Keep exact theorem names and headers; edit only `prove_e20263a9`.\n- Prohibit any meta/disallowed tactics (`native_decide`, `axiom`, etc.).\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 1 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: prompt_draft]\nPath: file:///tmp/agyhome.NWyWnj/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/d3e5d288-f78f-46c8-8e31-a1a54e2a343d/prompt_draft.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-11T14:45:03Z\n\n# Subagents\nThe following subagents were spawned during this conversation (up to 20).\nView the conversation log to see the full conversation with the subagent and use send_message with the conversation_id to communicate with th